umber" min="1" max="20" style="max-width:120px" id="desk-setting-10"><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">When a window holds this many visits, the front desk offers the next one instead of double-booking.</p></div></section></details><details class="card2 desk-details desk-business-group" name="business-details" id="pricesDetails"><summary><span>Prices &amp; common questions<small>The prices and answers customers can hear</small></span></summary><section class="card2 desk-settings-card"><div class="desk-section-heading"><div><h3>Published prices</h3><p class="muted">Only add prices you are comfortable sharing with customers.</p></div></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-11">Price list (service: price and note, one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" name="fees" id="desk-setting-11"></textarea></div></section><div class="card2"><h3>Customer questions</h3><p class="muted">One per line: Question? Answer. Your saved answers are the source. Review or remove any unanswered question before using it with customers.</p><textarea class="form-input" aria-label="Customer questions and answers" name="faq" style="min-height:220px"></textarea></div></details><details class="card2 desk-details desk-settings-details desk-business-group" name="business-details" id="safetyDetails"><summary><span>Safety &amp; handoffs<small>When to involve a person and what your front desk must never do</small></span></summary><section class="desk-settings-card"><div class="desk-section-heading"><div><h3>How to handle exceptions</h3><p class="muted">Keep life-safety instructions accurate and make clear when a person should take over.</p></div></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-12">Requests that need a person</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.handoff" id="desk-setting-12"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-13">Things your front desk must never do</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.never" id="desk-setting-13"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-14">Life-safety emergencies (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.emergencies.tier0" id="desk-setting-14"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-15">Urgent service requests (one per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.emergencies.tier1" id="desk-setting-15"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-16">Routine requests</label><input class="form-input" name="rules.emergencies.tier2" id="desk-setting-16" aria-describedby="routineRequestsHelp"><p class="muted" id="routineRequestsHelp">Leave blank to offer the next available window for routine requests.</p></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-17">Your safety script, in your words</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.emergencies.script" placeholder="Gas smell: leave the house, call CenterPoint or 911, then us." id="desk-setting-17"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-18">Notes for the front desk</label><textarea class="form-input" name="summary" id="desk-setting-18"></textarea></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-19">Numbers that always ring through to you (one per line, up to 20)</label><textarea class="form-input" name="rules.bypass" placeholder="Property managers, commercial accounts, family" id="desk-setting-19"></textarea><p class="muted" style="margin:6px 0 0">Calls from these numbers ring your cell and leave you a voicemail instead of reaching the front desk. Their texts are passed to you unanswered.</p></div></section></details><details class="card2 desk-details desk-business-group" name="business-details" id="contactDetails"><summary><span>Contact &amp; website chat<small>Your contact details, greeting and allowed websites</small></span></summary><div class="grid2"><section class="card2 desk-settings-card"><div class="desk-section-heading"><div><h3>Your contact details</h3><p class="muted">The contact information saved with your workspace.</p></div></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-20">Your name</label><input class="form-input" name="owner.name" id="desk-setting-20"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-21">Your contact cell</label><input class="form-input" name="owner.phone" id="desk-setting-21"></div><div class="desk-phone-profile-heading" id="phoneProfileHeading" hidden><h4>Phone answering details</h4><p class="muted">To keep an existing business line, save it here with a separate contact cell. You will choose forwarding or a new number when reviewing phone setup. Saving these details does not connect calls.</p><p class="muted" id="phoneFallbackNote">If the answering provider fails, the phone fallback uses your saved contact cell. Requests that need a person stay in Inbox. Live transfers require your separate approval below; a saved request and any email alert have separate statuses.</p></div><div class="form-group" id="phoneBusinessNumberGroup" hidden><label class="form-label" for="phoneBusinessNumber">Existing business line (optional for a new number)</label><input class="form-input" name="phone.businessNumber" id="phoneBusinessNumber" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="(713) 555-0142"><p class="muted">Use a different number from your contact cell if you plan to forward calls.</p></div><div class="form-group" id="phoneCarrierGroup" hidden><label class="form-label" for="phoneCarrier">Business line provider</label><select class="form-input" name="phone.carrier" id="phoneCarrier"><option value="">Choose a provider</option><option value="att">AT&amp;T</option><option value="verizon">Verizon</option><option value="tmobile">T-Mobile</option><option value="voip">VoIP / internet phone</option><option value="other">Other provider</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-22">Backup phone (optional)</label><input class="form-input" name="owner.backupPhone" placeholder="A second phone, not your cell" id="desk-setting-22"></div><div class="form-group" id="phoneHandoffGroup" hidden><label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start"><input type="checkbox" name="phone.handoffEnabled"> Allow caller-approved live transfers to the saved transfer phone, then the backup if nobody accepts.</label><p class="muted">I am authorized to route calls to these phones. Each attempt uses a separate call and reserves the full approved duration plus 30 seconds against phone usage limits. Up to two attempts are allowed. A person must press 1 before joining. The review timer starts when the call arrives. An unanswered call stays in Inbox; no callback time, text alert or emergency dispatch is promised. Save, review and test changed rules before use.</p></div><div class="form-group" id="transferGroup"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-23">Transfer calls that need you to</label><input class="form-input" name="phone.transferTo" placeholder="Your cell" id="desk-setting-23"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-24">Review unacknowledged requests after</label><select class="form-input" name="rules.ackMinutes" id="desk-setting-24"><option value="5">5 minutes</option><option value="10">10 minutes</option><option value="15">15 minutes</option><option value="30">30 minutes</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-25">Which calls the front desk takes</label><select class="form-input" name="phone.forwarding" id="desk-setting-25"><option value="missed">Only missed calls</option><option value="all">All calls</option><option value="none">Do not forward my business line</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-26">Callback promise during hours</label><input class="form-input" name="rules.callbackHours" placeholder="within 30 minutes" id="desk-setting-26"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-27">Callback promise after hours</label><input class="form-input" name="rules.callbackAfterHours" placeholder="by 8 am tomorrow" id="desk-setting-27"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-28">Google review link</label><input class="form-input" name="business.reviewLink" id="desk-setting-28"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-29">Payment link</label><input class="form-input" name="business.payLink" id="desk-setting-29"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Maintenance reminders</label><label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-weight:400"><input type="checkbox" name="rules.consentAsk"> After a happy review reply, ask the customer once whether they want a text when their next tune-up is due (they must reply YES before any such text goes out)</label></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Daily digest by text</label><label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-weight:400"><input type="checkbox" name="digest.text"> Include a daily text summary when text alerts are connected.</label></div><p class="muted" id="handoffNote" style="margin:10px 0 0">Contact methods depend on the services connected under Front desk.</p></section><section class="card2 desk-settings-card"><div class="desk-section-heading"><div><h3>Website chat</h3><p class="muted">The greeting and websites allowed to use your front desk.</p></div></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="desk-setting-32">Website chat greeting</label><input class="form-input" name="widget.greeting" id="desk-setting-32"></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="allowedOrigins">Websites allowed to use your chat (one full address per line)</label><textarea class="form-input" id="allowedOrigins" name="widget.allowedOrigins" placeholder="https://yourshop.com"></textarea><p class="muted">Include your website before installing the chat there. This does not import or change your website.</p></div></section></div></details><section id="cfgConflictPanel" class="card2 cfg-conflict" aria-labelledby="cfgConflictTitle" hidden><h3 id="cfgConflictTitle">Review the latest saved details</h3><p id="cfgConflictText">Your edits are still here. Check what changed before saving again.</p><div id="cfgConflictFields"></div><button type="button" class="btn-pill btn-pill-dark btn-sm" id="cfgCheckLatest">Check latest saved version</button> <button type="button" class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue btn-sm" id="cfgKeepEdits" hidden>Keep my edits and save</button></section><p class="desk-save-bar"><button type="submit" class="btn-pill btn-pill-blue" id="saveCfg">Save business details</button> <span class="muted" id="saveMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" tabindex="-1">Loading your saved details…</span></p></form>
